    {
      "text": "all men shall become immortal, 2 Ne. 9:13. when men have become immortal, they must appear before judgment-seat, 2 Ne. 9:15. mortal must put on immortality, Enos 1:27 (Mosiah 16:10; Alma 5:15; 12:12; 41:4; Morm. 6:21). mortal body to be raised to immortal body, Alma 11:45. mortal does not put on immortality until after Christ’s coming, Alma 40:2. Three Nephites shall be changed in twinkling of eye from mortality to immortality, 3 Ne. 28:8, 17.",
